description:
This is a solicitation for commercial construction in accordance with RFO parts 12 and 36.&nbsp; 



Solicitation number 12445527Q0008 is issued as a Request for Quotation (RFQ) for the upgrading of well equipment, including: submersible pump, buried pressure tank, frost-free hydrant, control box, pressure switch, pitless adapter, electrical wiring and extending the well casing. 



This acquisition&nbsp; is set-aside for small business concerns.&nbsp; The applicable North American Industry Classification Standard Code is 237110 Water and Sewer Line and Related Structures Construction.&nbsp; The small business size standard is $45,000,000.00. &nbsp;This acquisition is a Total Small Business Set-Aside.&nbsp; All responsible sources may submit a quotation which will be considered by the agency.&nbsp;
